17
00:02:29,009 --> 00:02:33,009
Yurin's caught in a big scandal! She was out all night!

18
00:02:33,009 --> 00:02:35,009
Well, I still believe her!

19
00:02:35,009 --> 00:02:40,009
She said it was just a good friend of hers and all they did was play games all night like friends do!

20
00:02:40,009 --> 00:02:42,009
