21
00:02:42,009 --> 00:02:46,009
Totally. Can't call yourself an otaku if you don't believe the idols you worship.

22
00:02:46,009 --> 00:02:47,009
Right? Only true-

23
00:02:47,009 --> 00:02:51,009
