24
00:02:51,009 --> 00:02:53,009
Cherry blossom viewing though, huh?

25
00:02:53,009 --> 00:02:59,009
I'd heard tales, but never thought it was real. Definitely didn't imagine I'd find myself joining.

26
00:02:59,009 --> 00:03:02,009
