31
00:03:18,009 --> 00:03:21,009
Let them kiss. Let them sleep over.

32
00:03:21,009 --> 00:03:23,009
So long as they're dating.

33
00:03:23,009 --> 00:03:27,009
Even I'd be angry if they spent the night and weren't even going out together.

34
00:03:27,009 --> 00:03:32,009
Talk about scandalous and upsetting her fans. Right? Know what I mean?

35
00:03:32,009 --> 00:03:38,009
Think about it. Yamada spent the night at the house of a guy she isn't even dating.

36
00:03:38,009 --> 00:03:45,009
That's the hard and honest truth. She might not be as famous as Yurin, but even still...

37
00:03:45,009 --> 00:03:49,009
